# Siya creative stack (desktop · mobile · cloud)

**Do not** treat `INSTAGRAM-STATIC.md` as the whole design system.

## Before any creative work — Read in order

1. `apps/siya-health/brand/AGENT-BOOTSTRAP.md` ← **full stack map**
2. `apps/siya-health/brand/BRAND-STYLE-LOCK.md` ← pixel tokens
3. `apps/siya-health/brand/VISUAL-OS.md`
4. `apps/siya-health/brand/VISUAL-OS-TEMPLATES.md`
5. `apps/siya-health/brand/EDITORIAL-OS.md` (when starting from research/insight)
6. `apps/siya-health/brand/prompts/README.md` (when drafting copy/prompts)

Then use what the brief needs: captions · founder voice · video-prompt · tracker · WorkDrive.

## Tokens (fail closed)

Cream `#F4EFE7` · Navy `#001878` · Dark Navy `#0A246B` · Magenta `#D81088` · Georgia + Arial · 4:5 1080×1350

