Plum `#8D3A78` · brown ink · hard-seam L · text shadows · ambient watermarks · freehand `GenerateImage` as **final** branded frame

## Required path

Classify → template ID → copy plan → source photo only → **`brand/scripts/compose_*.py`** → captions / video-prompt / tracker / WorkDrive

Also: `siya-visual-approval-gate.mdc` · `siya-a03-lean-lock.mdc` · `zoho-workdrive-team.mdc`

